方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_023_操夢.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「あとは、強いて言うなら過去を思い出したくらい…です。」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 23","slideTitle":"第23スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.023.jpeg","characterName":"操夢","id":"5214A7E6-84B4-459B-A5D6-A94AA161C76B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","voiceCharacter":"操夢"},{"voiceDuration":1.1213151927437641,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_024_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「ねぇ、あなたが言う、\nその過去について聞かせてくれないかしら？」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 24","slideTitle":"第24スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.024.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"A01F0526-6950-42D4-9C76-F264685FAC39","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第４話\/疑問顔.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":2.4039002267573695,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_025_操夢.wav","audioTrack":"track_voi