_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.040.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"5F2CCD67-DCD9-4607-B7AE-76E3B55BC42B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":8.281746031746032,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_041_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"私が咲夜を連れて、食堂に戻ると、そこではフランが驚きの表情をしていた。「フラン、キッチンから紅茶を出してちょうだい。」","duration":5.9,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 41","slideTitle":"第41スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.041.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"31F54DE0-41AF-4158-B6CE-915781993C3A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/フラン（驚く）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_042_射命丸文.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「わかった、今からとってくるね。」\n私はそう言うと、紅茶をとりにキッチンに向かった。","duration":4.1000000000000005,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 42","slideTitle":"第42スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.042.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","id":"2D0BD3ED-5B52-4BD4-9BBF-A9A13F711032","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":1.937596371882086},{"voiceDuration":3.2984126984126982,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_043_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「それで、何があったの、咲夜？」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 43","slideTitle":"第43スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.043.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"EE9E81D4-22E3-4D55-A884-01396FE3F6F5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":5.049297052154195,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_044_十六夜咲夜.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「実は…、深夜帯のテレビに、お嬢様が空を飛ぶ様子が、映ってまして…、それが今朝のニュースになっていたので…」","duration":5.4,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 44","slideTitle":"第44スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.044.jpeg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","id":"9AA28F66-3C6A-4002-9AA7-8D8A6963D43F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜"},{"voiceDuration":2.592154195011338,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_045_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「えっ？」私は、全く記憶にないことを指摘され、そう返す。","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 45","slideTitle":"第45スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.045.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"85E7C375-5145-4439-91C1-BB9DA6477DB7","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":2.1810884353741495,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_046_十六夜咲夜.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「その映像に映っている、お嬢様の様子をよく見ると、目から光が消えていて、その内容が報道されていたので…」","duration":5.2,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 46","slideTitle":"第46スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.046.jpeg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","id":"7E14BDA0-B585-4FDA-86FE-2631FAECB59A","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜"},{"voiceDuration":6.6439909297052155,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_047_赤面.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"私は彼女に言われ、再び昨晩の記憶を思い起こす、だが、自室で彼とフランの行方に不安になっていたことしか思い出せない。","duration":5.7,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 47","slideTitle":"第47スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.047.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"4B972687-5ABA-4021-952D-11220BE29171","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":1.857482993197279,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_048_十六夜咲夜.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「それで、その報道を見た、パチュリー様や、美鈴がお嬢様に電話をかけても、応答がなかったので…」","duration":4.7,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 48","slideTitle":"第48スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.048.jpeg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","id":"FBDB92A9-9362-4042-93F8-804A12A36A08","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜"},{"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_049_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"私は、紅茶を淹れたカップを咲夜とお姉様の前に出すと、二人がシーンと静まり返り、部屋には重たい空気が漂い始める。","duration":5.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 49","slideTitle":"第49スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.049.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","id":"D6F32627-A6AD-4E48-9D79-C1A74F09B6A8","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":9.334489795918367},{"voiceDuration":2.1254875283446713,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_050_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「それで、私のことはどう呼んでいたの？」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 50","slideTitle":"第50スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.050.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"4369E23B-5DD6-43CD-AB45-E35EC98270A4","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":7.290861678004535,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_051_ナレーション.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「今のところ、吸血鬼という正体は知られてませんが、知られるのは時間の問題で…、すぐにでも声明を出すべきかと…」","duration":5.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 51","slideTitle":"第51スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.051.jpeg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","id":"D0CC1716-396A-4505-AB9F-D3D2475211A2","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜"},{"voiceDuration":2.606734693877551,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_052_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「それに対する、学校側の反応は？」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 52","slideTitle":"第52スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.052.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"4137F206-793B-47D5-8347-5FE4E1AB314B","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":4.931678004535147,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_053_十六夜咲夜.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「今月の頭にあった例の件を、沈静化させるために注力したから、今すぐに、その報道への対抗策は打てないかと…」","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 53","slideTitle":"第53スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.053.jpeg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","id":"182B96EC-AC22-4D2B-8795-74AC9C6D483F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜"},{"voiceDuration":2.4546485260770976,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_054_レミリア・スカーレット_2.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「そう…、情報を知らせてくれてありがとう、咲夜…。」\n私は、動揺する自分を押さえ込みながら、そう彼女に言った。","duration":5.4,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 54","slideTitle":"第54スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.054.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"A51C7E8E-0DD3-4AA9-802B-0EEDDA2B3B9F","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":7.9563718820861675,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_055_赤面.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「ところで、彼はどこにいるのでしょうか？」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 55","slideTitle":"第55スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.055.jpeg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","id":"EE647247-CCDC-427E-80FA-CEFAFCD2ACB5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜"},{"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_056_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「彼なら、食器の片付けを済まして、図書館に向かったけど…」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 56","slideTitle":"第56スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.056.jpeg","characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","id":"4F8C2C0A-0635-4EE7-B0EE-D77FB0084FE9","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","voiceDuration":2.6419954648526076},{"voiceDuration":2.4119954648526076,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_057_霧雨魔理沙.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「そうですか…、では、これで失礼します。」私はそう言って、彼の元へ向かおうと動くと、お嬢様がそれを止める。","duration":5.300000000000001,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 57","slideTitle":"第57スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.057.jpeg","characterName":"十六夜咲夜","id":"CBFCB6EE-C41D-4E40-9B55-6B4A27916909","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"十六夜咲夜"},{"voiceDuration":6.958231292517007,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_058_レミリア・スカーレット.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%AC%E3%83%9F%E3%83%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「ちょっと待って、彼にどんな用事があるの？」","duration":3.5,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 58","slideTitle":"第58スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"backgroundName":"nc196979_食堂(昼).png","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.058.jpeg","characterName":"レミリア・スカーレット","id":"85438CB7-6A00-4904-827A-CD9EF987ECA5","characterImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第3話\/咲夜（困る）.png","voiceCharacter":"レミリア・スカーレット"},{"voiceDuration":7.95281179138322,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","seVolume":1,"voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_059_操夢.wav","audioTrack":"track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C","voiceStartTimeOffset":0,"telop":"「昨日、彼が校門を出ると、フランお嬢様の車に乗ったので、その確認ために、彼を連れ出すよう、学校に言われてまして…」","duration":5.7,"bgmStartTimeOffset":0,"animationName":"なし","transitionName":"なし","title":"シーン 59","slideTitle":"第59スライド","bgmVolume":0.65,"seStartTimeOffset":0,"voice2StartTimeOffset":0,"bac